<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-071" chapter-id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo" source-id="s-songshu-071-wangsengchuo">
  <p id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">王僧綽</persName>琅邪臨沂人左光禄大夫<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE">曇首</persName>子也幼有大成之度弱年衆以國器許<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0030" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">之</persName>好學有理思練悉朝典年十三<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0043" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>引見下拜便流涕哽咽<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0054" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>亦悲不自勝襲封豫章縣侯尚<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0067" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>長女<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0071" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAAA">東陽獻公主</persName>初為<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0078" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">江夏王義恭</persName>司徒參軍轉<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0088" type="unresolved">始興王</rs>文學袐書丞司徒左長史太子中庶子元嘉二十六年徙尚書吏部郎參掌大選䆒識流品諳悉人物㧞才舉能咸得其分二十八年遷侍中任以機密<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0149" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>沈深有局度不以才能髙人先是父<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0165" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAE">曇首</persName>與<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0168" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB">王華</persName>並為<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0172" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>所任<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0176" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB">華</persName>子<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0178" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">嗣</persName>人才既劣位遇亦輕<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0187" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>嘗謂中書侍郎<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0195" ref="fcu_pw8_tkw">蔡興宗</persName>曰<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0199" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">弟</persName>名位應與<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0204" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">新建</persName>齊超至今日盖由姻戚所致也<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0218" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">新建</persName>者<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0221" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABA">嗣</persName>之封也及為侍中時年二十九<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0234" ref="3b1_39e_aa6">始興王濬</persName>嘗問<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0240" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">其</persName>年<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0242" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>自嫌蚤逹逡廵良久乃荅<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p001:m0254" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">其</persName>謙虚自退若此</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">元嘉末<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0003" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>頗以後事為念以<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0012" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">其</persName>年少方欲大相付託朝政小大皆與參焉從兄<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0031" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAADA">徽</persName>清介士也懼<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0037" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">其</persName>太盛勸令損抑<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0044" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>乃求吳郡及廣州<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p002:m0053" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>並不許</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">㑹<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0001" type="unresolved">二凶</rs>巫蠱事泄<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0007" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>獨先召<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0011" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>具言之及将廢立使尋求前朝舊典<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0027" ref="fof_k8v_7md">劭</persName>於東宫夜饗將士<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0035" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>密以啓聞<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0041" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>又令撰漢魏以來廢諸王故事撰畢送與<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0058" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0060" ref="spx_gk1_rrr">徐湛之</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0063" ref="spx_gk1_rrr">湛之</persName>欲立<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0067" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">隨王誕</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0070" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>欲立<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0074" ref="ece_336_e4c">南平王鑠</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0078" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>欲立<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0082" ref="ccd_af3_98e">建平王宏</persName>議久不決<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0090" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0091" ref="spx_gk1_rrr_A">妃</persName>即<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0093" ref="spx_gk1_rrr">湛之</persName>女<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0096" ref="ece_336_e4c">鑠</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0097" ref="vwx_acg_r0a">妃</persName>即<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0099" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">湛</persName>妹<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0101" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>謂<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0104" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>曰<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0107" type="unresolved">諸人</rs>各為身計便無與國家同憂者<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0121" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>曰建立之事仰由聖懐<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0132" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">臣</persName>謂唯宜速斷不可稽緩當斷不斷反受其亂願以義割恩略小不忍不爾便應坦懐如初無煩疑論淮南云以石投水吳越之善沒取之事機雖密易致宣廣不可使難生慮表取笑千載<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0204" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>曰<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0206" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">卿</persName>可謂能斷大事此事重不可不殷勤三思且<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0224" type="unresolved">庶人</rs>始亡人将謂<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0231" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">我</persName>無復慈愛之道<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0238" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>曰<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0241" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">臣</persName>恐千載之後言<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0248" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">陛下</persName>唯能裁<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0253" type="unresolved">弟</rs>不能裁<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0257" type="unresolved">兒</rs><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0258" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">上</persName>黙然<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0261" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>同侍坐出閤謂<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0269" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>曰<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0272" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">卿</persName>向言将不大傷切直<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0281" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>曰<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0284" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">弟</persName>亦恨<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p003:m0287" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">君</persName>不直</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">及<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0001" ref="fof_k8v_7md">劭</persName>弑逆<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0004" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>在尚書上省聞變歎曰不用<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>言以至扵此<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0024" ref="fof_k8v_7md">劭</persName>既立轉為吏部尚書委以事任事在<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0039" type="unresolved">二凶</rs>傳頃之<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0044" ref="fof_k8v_7md">劭</persName>料檢<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0047" ref="3qs_nqa_ioa_AAAA">太祖</persName>巾箱及<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0052" ref="o1i_tao_gu1">江湛</persName>家書䟽得<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0058" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>所啓饗士并廢諸王事乃收害焉時年三十一因此陷北第諸王侯以為<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0088" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>有異志并殺<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0095" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>門客太學博士<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0103" ref="fsv_gtc_5yb">賈匪之</persName>奉朝請<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0109" ref="mxi_dvi_qls">司馬文穎</persName>建平國常侍<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0118" ref="7qy_l3t_lye">司馬仲秀</persName>等<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p004:m0123" ref="hx8_st4_jdd">世祖</persName>即位追贈散騎常侍金紫光禄大夫謚曰愍侯</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">初太社西空地一區吳時<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0010" ref="nd1_eoc_wrb">丁奉</persName>宅<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0013" ref="05e_9bb_55a">孫晧</persName>流徙<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0017" ref="nd1_eoc_wrb">其</persName>家江左初為<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0023" ref="3xx_gdy_or6_AAA">周顗</persName><persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0025" ref="lrg_cze_g1l">蘇峻</persName>宅其後為<rs id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0031" type="unresolved">袁悅</rs>宅又為<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0036" ref="0vi_pxk_rw2">章武王司馬秀</persName>宅皆以凶終後給<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0049" ref="fx3_a98_dj5">臧夀</persName>亦頗遇喪禍故世稱為凶地<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0062" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEA">僧綽</persName>常以正逹自居謂宅無吉凶請以為第始就造築未及居而敗子<persName id="c-songshu-071-wangsengchuo:p005:m0089" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>嗣昇明末為齊國尚書右僕射</p>
</text>
